  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Institutional Partnerships in Mozambique: a focus on M&amp;E and accountability approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD in Mozambique at the end of 2014 started rethinking the way of partnerships. CAFOD&#x2019;s partners recognized their limitations in organizational and operational capacity and thus, the need to further work on capacity strengthening. The challenge was to increase transparency and start applying accountability mechanisms, as well as train staff in project management in order to achieve project objectives. CAFOD in Mozambique has been working with partners in this area of capacity strengthening and some progress has been accomplished but more support is still needed and necessary to redress the imbalance of power.</narrative>
  </description>
